B.awS=new A.nA("When ghusl is required","Ghusl is obligatory after marital relations, after ejaculation, when menstruation ends, and when post-natal bleeding ends. The Friday bath is a strong sunnah.")
B.awN=new A.nA("What makes it valid","Water must reach the whole body, including the roots of the hair. A woman does not have to undo a braid if water can reach the roots. Intention is made in the heart.")
B.awR=new A.nA("The way of the Prophet \ufdfa","Aisha described his ghusl: he washed his hands, washed the private area, performed wudu as for prayer, then poured water over his head three times, then over the rest of his body. Reported in Sahih al-Bukhari.")
B.awP=new A.nA("1. Intention and Bismillah","Intend the ghusl in your heart. Begin in the name of Allah.")
B.awT=new A.nA("2. Wash the hands and the private area","Wash both hands, then wash away what must be removed from the body.")
B.awM=new A.nA("3. Make wudu","Perform wudu as you would for salah. Washing the feet may be left until the end if you are standing where the water gathers.")
B.awO=new A.nA("4. Pour water over the head","Three times, working the fingers through the hair so the water reaches the scalp.")
B.awQ=new A.nA("5. Wash the whole body","Pour water over the right side, then the left, and make sure nothing is left dry: the navel, behind the ears, and under the arms.")
B.a3h=A.a(s([B.awS,B.awN,B.awR,B.awP,B.awT,B.awM,B.awO,B.awQ]),A.ah("A<nA>"))
